page diagnostics {
  i18n {
    title { en "Diagnostics" zh "诊断" }
    desc { en "Review the latest recorded health checks. Operator commands and platform details are in Advanced." zh "查看最近记录的节点自检结果；运行命令与平台说明见「高级」。" }
    gate-title { en "Diagnostics" zh "诊断" }
    gate-desc { en "Sign in with DID Wallet to see this instance's self-check results." zh "使用 DID Wallet 登录后查看本实例的自检结果。" }
    login { en "Sign in with DID Wallet" zh "使用 DID Wallet 登录" }
    tab-checks { en "Self-check" zh "自检" }
    tab-advanced { en "Advanced" zh "高级" }
    sum-title { en "Last self-check (recorded)" zh "最近一次自检（已记录）" }
    sum-ok { en "Overall ok" zh "总体结论 ok" }
    sum-count { en "Checks / failed / warnings" zh "已记录 / 失败 / 警告" }
    sum-empty { en "Results reflect the last recorded run. If no rows appear, run the recording command in Advanced; a blank list does not mean all checks passed." zh "结果以上次记录为准。列表没有记录时，请在「高级」运行记录命令；空列表不代表全部通过。" }
    list-title { en "Every check, one row each" zh "全部检查项，逐条一行" }
    list-desc { en "Each row shows a recorded check, its original result and the time it ran." zh "逐项展示已记录的检查、原始结果和执行时间。" }
    adv-desc { en "Level-3 detail, folded here: storage & index, the log surface, data export / backup, the permission surface, the background intent queue and first-line troubleshooting. Every command is copy-and-run; nothing on this page executes. How to read them: run the storage audit bare — it answers through its exit code (0 = every layout is files and the index is fresh) and its JSON report grows past 64KB, so a piped fragment is not a report (arc-contracts §4.1a). arc space sync converges --to toward --from and --mirror DELETES destination-only files, so preview with --dry-run. The AFS records are the source of truth and dist/ is rebuildable, so keep an OFFLINE copy of node.key (content-signing key) and .env.local (chain configuration) outside this repo — they are not AFS records; losing them loses the node identity, and they must never be committed or written into AFS. DID Space: /user is a caller-scoped projection, not a directory — arc space list --scope user and arc space path --scope user address it (substitute the app DID), and the reading-list CLI addresses records by reader DID; this daemon has AFS_DID_SPACE_SCOPE_SECRET UNSET, so scope directories are plaintext (de-identification OFF) — a daemon environment variable ArcBlog can only register as a production prerequisite, never set. Permissions: this platform gives the app exactly two roles, guest and admin (blocklet.yaml replicated.readRole / minRole) — there is no finer grant to look for. Background work: a console chain button only writes an intent record; the node's own worker signs it on the chain (the signing key never reaches the browser) — that is the worker command above. No heartbeat record exists anywhere in this codebase, so an empty queue is a normal state, not an error, and there is no last-seen time to show." zh "三级细节，折叠在此：存储与索引、日志面、数据导出/备份、权限面、后台意图队列与常见问题自助定位。所有命令一律「复制后自行执行」，本页不执行任何命令。读法：存储审计直接运行——结论看退出码（0 = 所有布局已是 files 且索引新鲜），它的 JSON 报告会超过 64KB，加管道截下来的片段不能当报告（arc-contracts §4.1a）。arc space sync 让 --to 向 --from 收敛，--mirror 会删除目的端多余文件，所以先用 --dry-run 预演。AFS 记录才是真源、dist/ 可由源码重建，因此必须在仓库之外离线备份 node.key（内容签名密钥）与 .env.local（链配置）——它们不是 AFS 记录，丢了等于丢了节点身份，且绝不提交、绝不写进 AFS。DID Space：/user 是按调用者分区的投影、不是目录——用 arc space list --scope user 与 arc space path --scope user 访问（替换成实际 app DID），阅读清单 CLI 则按读者 DID 寻址记录；本 daemon 未设置 AFS_DID_SPACE_SCOPE_SECRET，作用域目录为明文（反标识关闭）——它是 daemon 的环境变量，ArcBlog 只能登记为生产前置条件，不能替它设置。权限：本平台只给应用 guest 与 admin 两档角色（blocklet.yaml 的 replicated.readRole / minRole），没有更细的授权可找。后台任务：控制台的链上按钮只写一条意图记录，由节点自己的 worker 在链上签名（签名密钥不进浏览器）——即上方的 worker 命令。本仓库不存在任何心跳记录，因此队列为空是正常状态、不是错误，也没有「最后可见时间」可显示。" }
    cmd-record { en "Run the self-check and record it — the source of the summary above; --help lists the checks and the record shape" zh "运行自检并落成记录——即上方摘要的数据来源；--help 列出检查项与记录形状" }
    cmd-check { en "Audit storage and index, read-only (run it bare and read the exit code; --folder <space-dir> audits one claimed folder)" zh "审计存储与索引，只读（直接运行、看退出码；--folder <space-dir> 只审计一个已声明目录）" }
    cmd-repair { en "Rebuild one folder's ledger from disk" zh "从磁盘重建某个目录的账本" }
    cmd-logs { en "The only log surface: the daemon log (add --json, or -i <instance>)" zh "唯一的日志面：daemon 日志（可加 --json，或 -i <实例>）" }
    cmd-backup { en "Preview a mirror export (writes nothing); drop --dry-run to run it" zh "预演镜像导出（不写任何东西）；去掉 --dry-run 才真正执行" }
    cmd-perm { en "Re-run the guest permission matrix alone" zh "单独重跑访客权限矩阵" }
    cmd-worker { en "Keep draining pending chain intents (long-running); run drains once" zh "持续排空待处理的链上意图（长驻进程）；run 表示只排空一次" }
    intents-title { en "Background work (intent queue)" zh "后台任务（意图队列）" }
    intents-status { en "status" zh "状态" }
    faq-title { en "First-line troubleshooting (symptom → check)" zh "常见问题自助定位（症状 → 判据）" }
    faq { en "A save looked accepted but the record is unchanged: the toast is not evidence — read the record back with arc afs exec /blocklets/arcblog/.actions/read --args '{\"path\":\"<afs path>\"}' --json (arc-contracts §29.4). A write was refused: conditional, not absolute — it depends on the record's origin, the write mode and the daemon process (§29.2); probe before deleting, because delete + recreate loses createdAt. A record disappeared from a filtered list: filter / serverFilters push a query to the index and an edit leaves its index entry stale (§15) — re-check through arc afs exec /blocklets/arcblog/.actions/list --args '{\"path\":\"<dir>\"}' --json. ?page=<id> silently lands on the public home: that id is not a registered page — the authoritative page set is the sidebar model, guarded in the fast tier (npm test). A read is denied for a signed-in session: the record's directory prefix decides (blocklet.yaml replicated.readRole / minRole, §13); there is no third role to grant. Storage keeps growing: audit read-only first, then rebuild one folder's ledger (both commands above); dev-instance test residue is swept by arcblog-clean.mjs, dry-run by default. A publish never reached the public site: record a self-check (command above) and read the space-layout / resources rows; Node registry state lives on ?page=registry." zh "保存看似成功但记录没变：toast 不是证据——回读记录：arc afs exec /blocklets/arcblog/.actions/read --args '{\"path\":\"<afs 路径>\"}' --json（arc-contracts §29.4）。写入被拒：条件性而非绝对——与记录来源、写入模式和当时的 daemon 进程相关（§29.2）；先探针再动手，删除重建会丢掉 createdAt。记录在筛选列表里消失：filter / serverFilters 会下推为服务端索引查询，而编辑记录会留下陈旧索引（§15）——改用目录列表复核：arc afs exec /blocklets/arcblog/.actions/list --args '{\"path\":\"<目录>\"}' --json。?page=<id> 静默回落公开首页：该 id 不是已注册页面——权威页面集合就是侧栏模型，由快层（npm test）守卫。已登录会话读取被拒：取决于记录所在目录前缀（blocklet.yaml 的 replicated.readRole / minRole，§13），没有第三档角色可授。存储持续膨胀：先只读审计，再重建某个目录的账本（两条命令见上）；开发实例的测试残留由 arcblog-clean.mjs 清理（默认 dry-run）。发布没有到达公开站点：记录一次自检（命令见上）并查看 space-layout / resources 两行；节点注册表状态见 ?page=registry。" }
  }
  view gap=lg style={height: "100vh", overflow: visible} {
    view style={gap: "0"} {
      view gap=sm style={background: "var(--card-bg)", border: "var(--card-border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius-lg, 10px)", padding: "20px"} visible="!$session.authenticated" {
        h2 :gate-title level=2 style={fontSize: "var(--type-body)"}
        p :gate-desc intent=muted
        row cross=start {
          action -> navigate "/.well-known/service/login?return_to=%2F%3Fpage%3Ddiagnostics&cancel_to=%2F%3Fpage%3Ddiagnostics" variant=primary label=:login style={borderRadius: "var(--radius-md, 8px)"}
        }
      }
      row gap=lg cross=stretch style={width: "100vw", marginLeft: "calc(50% - 50vw)", height: "calc(100vh - 48px)", marginBottom: "-52px", padding: "0 32px 0 0"} visible=$session.authenticated {
        view size={width: "clamp(200px, 15vw, 280px)", flexShrink: 0, height: "100%"} style={padding: "0", background: "var(--color-surface)", borderRight: "1px solid var(--color-border)", overflowY: auto, gap: "0", height: "100%"} visible=$session.authenticated {
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-content)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-dashboard)" -> page dashboard style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-studio)" -> page posts style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-pages)" -> page pages style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-write)" -> page compose style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-site)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-heroes)" -> page heroes style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-categories)" -> page categories style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-tags)" -> page tags style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-feeds)" -> page feeds style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-ops)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-operations)" -> page operations style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-registry)" -> page registry style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-factory)" -> page factory style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-agents)" -> page agents style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-settings)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-settings)" -> page general style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-diagnostics)" -> page diagnostics active=true style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view gap=xs style={padding: "10px 20px 10px 32px", background: "var(--color-bg)", borderTop: "1px solid var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} visible="!$session.isAdmin" {
            p "$t(wrapper.admin-notice)" scale=caption intent=muted
          }
        }
        view gap=md size={flex: 1} style={paddingTop: "14px", paddingBottom: "14px", minHeight: 0} {
          row gap=md cross=center {
            view gap=xs size={flex: 1} style={padding: "4px 0 16px", borderBottom: "1px solid var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
              h2 :title level=2
              p :desc intent=muted
            }
          }
          view gap=sm size={flex: 1} style={overflowY: auto} {
            view mode=tabs {
              view gap=sm label=:tab-checks {
                view gap=sm style={borderTop: "1px solid var(--color-border)", paddingTop: "18px", flexShrink: 0} {
                  h3 :sum-title level=3
                  afs-list diagnostics-summary-list layout=list itemStyle=row subscribe=true showBreadcrumb=false showParent=false autoSelect=false clickMode=none pagination=manual pageSize=10 from "/instance/app/arcblog/config/diagnostics/summary" {
                    view gap=xs role=item {
                      view gap=sm size={width: fill} {
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          time mode=display value="${entry.content.ranAt}" timeMode=relative
                        }
                        key-value-list dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(diagnostics.sum-ok)", value: "${entry.content.ok}"}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.sum-count)", value: "${entry.content.count} / ${entry.content.failed} / ${entry.content.warnings}"}]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                  p :sum-empty scale=caption intent=muted
                }
                view gap=sm style={borderTop: "1px solid var(--color-border)", paddingTop: "18px", flexShrink: 0} {
                  h3 :list-title level=3
                  p :list-desc scale=sm intent=muted
                  afs-list diagnostics-checks-list layout=list itemStyle=row subscribe=true showBreadcrumb=false showParent=false autoSelect=false clickMode=none pagination=manual pageSize=10 from "/instance/app/arcblog/config/diagnostics/checks" {
                    view gap=xs role=item {
                      view gap=sm size={width: fill} {
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          h3 "${entry.content.id}"
                          p "${entry.content.severity} · ${entry.content.ok}" scale=sm intent=muted
                          time mode=display value="${entry.content.ranAt}" timeMode=relative
                        }
                        p "${entry.content.detail}" scale=sm intent=muted
                      }
                    }
                  }
                  p :sum-empty scale=caption intent=muted
                }
              }
              view gap=sm label=:tab-advanced {
                p :adv-desc scale=sm intent=muted
                key-value-list diagnostics-advanced-cmds dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-record)", value: "node scripts/arcblog-doctor.mjs --record", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-check)", value: "arc space check", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-repair)", value: "arc space repair --folder <space-dir>", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-logs)", value: "arc service logs --follow", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-backup)", value: "arc space sync --from <space-dir> --to <dir> --mirror --dry-run", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-perm)", value: "npm run test:file -- scripts/arcblog-permissions.test.mjs", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(diagnostics.cmd-worker)", value: "node scripts/arcblog-chain-worker.mjs watch", monospace: true, copyable: true}]
                h3 :intents-title level=3
                afs-list diagnostics-chain-intents-list layout=list itemStyle=row subscribe=true showBreadcrumb=false showParent=false autoSelect=false clickMode=none pagination=manual pageSize=10 from "/instance/app/arcblog/config/chain-intents" {
                  view gap=xs role=item {
                    view gap=sm size={width: fill} {
                      h3 "${entry.content.action} · ${entry.content.role}"
                      row gap=xs cross=center {
                        p "$t(diagnostics.intents-status): ${entry.content.status}" scale=sm intent=muted
                        time mode=display value="${entry.content.updatedAt}" timeMode=relative
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
                key-value-list diagnostics-faq dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(diagnostics.faq-title)", value: "$t(diagnostics.faq)"}]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
